## Who can join

Researchers who have stood out in Germanic Studies through scientific work, such as a doctorate, and in particular those who teach in higher education.

## How it works

1. You fill in the pre-registration on this page.
2. The Executive Management checks the data and forwards the request.
3. The IVG presidency decides on admission, as provided by the statutes.
4. You receive the confirmation by email.

The pre-registration form goes live with the launch of the website. Until then, get in touch with IVG Brasil through the [contact page](../contato/).

## What members receive

- A vote in the IVG general assemblies
- Calls for papers and news about the Rio 2030 Congress before everyone else
- A place in the community of Germanists in Brazil and around the world
